        "calls": 1,
        "title": "Add side chat support to desktop cloud contracts",
        "summary": "New side chat capability added to the shared desktop-cloud contract in the `common` package, enabling read-only companion chats alongside active device sessions. The `harness_start` schema in `device-execution.ts` gains a `readOnly` flag, while `history.ts` introduces the `CloudHistorySideChat` type and `SIDE_CHAT_COPIED_RUN_PREFIX` constant to distinguish copied parent runs from new side chat turns. The `HostedWorkspaceHost` interface adds an optional `sideChat` capability so clients can gate the chat menu option based on build support.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "The diff adds a `readOnly` literal to the `harness_start` schema in `device-execution.ts`, introduces `CloudHistorySideChat` and `SIDE_CHAT_COPIED_RUN_PREFIX` in `history.ts`, and adds a `sideChat` capability flag to `HostedWorkspaceHost` in `hosted-workspace.ts`.",
